    "blogtextliquid_ra7Awx": {
      "type": "editorial--blog-text-liquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Scentspired was founded on a simple premise: great fragrance is a question of chemistry and craftsmanship, not billboard budgets. By cutting out celebrity endorsements, proprietary bottle molds, and luxury retail markups, we can invest directly in the juice itself.</p><p>We source premium fragrance oils from the world's leading perfume houses in Grasse, France, and formulate at Eau de Parfum and Extrait de Parfum concentrations (20% to 30% oil). The result is inspired luxury perfumes that match the scent profile, depth, and longevity of the originals—at a price that makes them an everyday pleasure.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_ji7beH": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "blog_editorial_text_section_zNd6WG": {
          "type": "blog--editorial-text-section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Traditional Retail Model vs The Scentspired Standard",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.1,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 30,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 25,
            "column_1_text": "<p>Traditional luxury houses spend tens of millions of dollars each year maintaining brand prestige. Between international licensing fees, supermodel contracts, and the margins taken by department stores, consumer prices are inflated tenfold before a single spray leaves the nozzle.</p><p>Because so much money is tied up in marketing, many designer brands quietly dilute their formulas to Eau de Toilette concentrations (8-12% oil) to protect profit margins, leaving you with a scent that fades before lunch.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>We do things backwards. We start by investing in the highest grade perfume oils, working with master perfumers to capture the exact olfactory pyramid of the world's most sought-after fragrances.</p><p>Because we sell directly to you online, 100% of our focus is on wear-time, projection, and ingredient purity. You get 8 to 12 hours of rich, nuanced fragrance without the $300 penalty for a designer logo.</p>",
            "body_size": 17,
            "body_size_mobile": 15,
            "body_line_height": 1.9,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 55,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "blog_editorial_text_section_zNd6WG"
      ],
      "name": "Editorial text section",
      "settings": {}
    },
    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "blog_narrative_content_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "blog--narrative-content",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>Concentration without compromise</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>When you buy an inspired perfume, concentration is everything. Cheap dupes cut corners with industrial alcohol bases that evaporate violently, smelling harsh for five minutes and completely disappearing thirty minutes later.</p><p>Every bottle in the Scentspired collection is formulated at a minimum of 20% fragrance oil concentration. That means the top notes transition seamlessly into rich heart notes, anchored by deep resins, woods, and musks that cling to your skin all day long.</p><p><strong>Addiction</strong> (inspired by Baccarat Rouge 540) and <strong>Fierce</strong> (inspired by Sauvage Parfum by Dior) are proof that you don't need to choose between affordability and performance.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>Fragrance as an everyday ritual</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>When a perfume costs $350, you save it for anniversaries, galas, and special occasions. It sits on your dresser, slowly degrading under bedroom lighting, while you hesitate to use it on an ordinary Tuesday.</p><p>We believe fragrance should be part of how you show up in the world every day. Whether you're heading into a morning meeting, grabbing coffee, or relaxing at home, you deserve to smell unforgettable without doing mental math about cost-per-spray.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "blog_narrative_content_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
