        "blog_editorial_callout_section_m8PFU4": {
          "type": "blog--editorial-callout-section",
          "settings": {
            "container_width": 1100,
            "left_column_width": 45,
            "right_column_width": 55,
            "column_gap": 50,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "heading": "What this means when you are shopping",
            "heading_font": "serif",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "mobile_heading_size": 28,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_indent": 0,
            "mobile_heading_indent": 0,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/magnific__create-a-premium-luxury-perfume-product-photograph__85315.png",
            "image_max_width": 500,
            "heading_image_gap": 16,
            "mobile_heading_image_gap": 20,
            "body_text": "<p>If you have never purchased an inspired fragrance before, start with a scent profile you already love. Check the olfactory notes—the top, heart, and base notes—and compare our inspired formulation directly against the designer bottle on your dresser.</p><p>Spray once on your wrist and give it 15 minutes to settle through the opening alcohol. Once the perfume warms with your body temperature, you will experience the identical luxurious drydown and complex scent trail that made the original iconic.</p>",
            "body_font": "system_ui_n4",
            "body_size": 17,
            "mobile_body_size": 15,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
